WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.138
Step 8 runs the reachability
check against the test workspace.

2
00:00:04.138 --> 00:00:07.013
Step 9 plans the rollback
before you need it.

3
00:00:07.013 --> 00:00:10.113
Step 10 records each folder as evidence.

4
00:00:10.113 --> 00:00:14.980
Then the go or no-go: the stage is a go
when every file matches its hash list,

5
00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:18.856
the chain is unbroken, and the
preflight, validation, plan,

6
00:00:18.856 --> 00:00:23.063
deployment and reachability each
have a passing live record.

7
00:00:23.063 --> 00:00:24.899
Fixture records never count.

8
00:00:24.899 --> 00:00:29.520
A no-go is a finding with an owner, and
the stage is repeated after the fix.
